scribble dash at (65, 44)
scribble dash at (60, 40)
scribble dash at (55, 36)
scribble dash at (52, 32)
scribble dash at (75, 52)
scribble dash at (68, 46)
scribble dash at (62, 42)
scribble dash at (57, 38)

# Front Right Petal - mirror elegance
